menu "JetKVM identity"

config JETKVM_BENCH_CUSTOM_MAC
    bool "Bench only: pretend that eFuse holds the factory MAC 02:4a:4b:00:00:01"
    default n
    help
        Report the locally administered address 02:4a:4b:00:00:01 as the
        factory MAC of eFuse USER_DATA.MAC_CUSTOM, so that a bench Mini without
        that field tests the MAC address setting. Bench builds only: the
        release check (tools/release_config.py) refuses a build with it.

endmenu
